  {
    "client_msg_id": "d6017a13-1507-4e0a-b9a2-d7bcdf732e9d",
    "type": "message",
    "user": "U08S0TP9R3P",
    "text": "hey \u003c@U0CL0QSS929\u003e\nCould you please run the following two queries and share the output of each?\n\nEach query will run for *5 minutes*.\n\n*Query 1: Raw oplog read through mongos* ```const start = Math.floor(Date.now() / 1000) - 3600, began = Date.now();\nlet events = 0, pos = start;\nconst cs = db.getMongo().watch([], { startAtOperationTime: Timestamp({ t: start, i: 0 }) });\nwhile (Date.now() - began \u0026lt; 300000) {\n  const doc = cs.tryNext();\n  if (doc) { events++; pos = doc.clusterTime.getHighBits(); }\n  else { const tok = cs.getResumeToken(); if (tok \u0026amp;\u0026amp; tok._data) pos = parseInt(tok._data.substr(2, 8), 16); }\n}\ncs.close();\nconst wall = (Date.now() - began) / 1000;\nprint(`raw: oplog_covered=${pos - start}s speed=${((pos - start) / wall).toFixed(2)}x events=${events} events_per_sec=${(events / wall).toFixed(1)}`);``` \n*Query 2: OLake-style read of one collection* ```const start = Math.floor(Date.now() / 1000) - 3600, began = Date.now();\nlet events = 0, pos = start;\ndb.getMongo().setReadConcern(\"majority\");\nconst cs = db.getSiblingDB(\"juno_v2_prod_money\").generic_gv.watch(\n  [{ $match: { operationType: { $in: [\"insert\", \"update\", \"replace\", \"delete\"] } } }],\n  { startAtOperationTime: Timestamp({ t: start, i: 0 }), fullDocument: \"updateLookup\", fullDocumentBeforeChange: \"whenAvailable\", maxAwaitTimeMS: 2000 }\n);\nwhile (Date.now() - began \u0026lt; 300000) {\n  const doc = cs.tryNext();\n  if (doc) { events++; pos = doc.clusterTime.getHighBits(); }\n  else { const tok = cs.getResumeToken(); if (tok \u0026amp;\u0026amp; tok._data) pos = parseInt(tok._data.substr(2, 8), 16); }\n}\ncs.close();\nconst wall = (Date.now() - began) / 1000;\nprint(`olake: oplog_covered=${pos - start}s speed=${((pos - start) / wall).toFixed(2)}x events=${events} events_per_sec=${(events / wall).toFixed(1)}`);```",
    "ts": "1795441692.749549",
    "thread_ts": "1795441190.769959",
    "parent_user_id": "U0CL0QSS929",
    "team": "T0820LGJGRF",
    "replace_original": false,
    "delete_original": false,
    "metadata": {
      "event_type": "",
      "event_payload": null
    },
    "blocks": [
      {
        "type": "rich_text",
        "block_id": "a/Cm/",
        "elements": [
          {
            "type": "rich_text_section",
            "elements": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "hey "
              },
              {
                "type": "user",
                "user_id": "U0CL0QSS929"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "\nCould you please run the following two queries and share the output of each?\n\nEach query will run for "
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "5 minutes",
                "style": {
                  "bold": true
                }
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": ".\n\n"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Query 1: Raw oplog read through mongos",
                "style": {
                  "bold": true
                }
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "rich_text",
        "block_id": "GL2Ub",
        "elements": [
          {
            "type": "rich_text_preformatted",
            "elements": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "const start = Math.floor(Date.now() / 1000) - 3600, began = Date.now();\nlet events = 0, pos = start;\nconst cs = db.getMongo().watch([], { startAtOperationTime: Timestamp({ t: start, i: 0 }) });\nwhile (Date.now() - began \u003c 300000) {\n  const doc = cs.tryNext();\n  if (doc) { events++; pos = doc.clusterTime.getHighBits(); }\n  else { const tok = cs.getResumeToken(); if (tok \u0026\u0026 tok._data) pos = parseInt(tok._data.substr(2, 8), 16); }\n}\ncs.close();\nconst wall = (Date.now() - began) / 1000;\nprint(`raw: oplog_covered=${pos - start}s speed=${((pos - start) / wall).toFixed(2)}x events=${events} events_per_sec=${(events / wall).toFixed(1)}`);"
              }
            ],
            "border": 0,
            "language": "javascript"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "rich_text",
        "block_id": "rJSJW",
        "elements": [
          {
            "type": "rich_text_section",
            "elements": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "\n"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Query 2: OLake-style read of one collection",
                "style": {
                  "bold": true
